        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eric Clapton, Ann Wilson\n- Roles: Guitarist, singer, songwriter, vocalist\n- Organizations: Rolling Stone, Gibson, Time, Hit Parader\n- Topics: Music rankings, greatest musicians lists\n\nFacts:\n- Eric Clapton was born on 30 March 1945.\n- Eric Clapton is an English rock and blues guitarist, singer, and songwriter.\n- In 2006, Hit Parader listed Ann Wilson as one of the \"Top Heavy Metal Vocalists of All Time.\"\n- In 2009, Time named Eric Clapton number five on its list of \"The 10 Best Electric Guitar Players.\"\n- Rolling Stone ranked Eric Clapton second on its list of the \"100 Greatest Guitarists of All Time.\"\n- Gibson ranked Eric Clapton fourth on its \"Top 50 Guitarists of All Time\" list.",
